before_due.body:
Hello,

A friendly note that invoice {number} for {amount} is due on {due}.

If payment is already on its way, thank you. If anything on the invoice needs a second look, just reply to this email.

Thank you,
{agency}
{phone}
{email}

overdue.body:
Hello,

Our records show {amount} still open on invoice {number}, which was due on {due} ({days} days ago).

Could you let us know when we can expect payment? If there is a question about the hours or the rates, reply and we will sort it out.

Thank you,
{agency}
{phone}
{email}

final.body:
Hello,

Invoice {number} still has {amount} open and is now {days} days past its due date of {due}.

Please arrange payment this week, or reply to tell us what is holding it up so we can resolve it together.

Thank you,
{agency}
{phone}
{email}
